OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog appeals decision in
OL,4,Asexual misconduct case
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe General Medical Council (GMC) has
OL,7,Fappealed a tribunal decision that
OL,8,Fcleared a doctor of sexually harassing
OL,9,Ffour female medical students.
OL,11,FLast month, a Medical Practitioners
OL,12,FTribunal Service panel found physical
OL,13,Fcontact by Dr Adam Chesters was not
OL,14,Fmeant in a sexual way, but he had
OL,15,Fcommitted misconduct.
OL,17,FHe was handed a warning over the
OL,18,Fincidents, which took place during
OL,19,Feducation sessions in Cambridge and
OL,20,FEdinburgh.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
